    365  f1ac							; TitleSelect — MOVED to bank1 (refactor_v4_plan Phase 3.1 canary, 2026-10-16).
    366  f1ac							; Entered via CallPad_TitleSelect ($FC4F); returns C=1 edge / C=0 no-edge.
    367  f1ac
    368  f1ac
    369  f1ac							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    370  f1ac							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    371  f1ac							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    372  f1ac							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    373  f1ac							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    374  f1ac							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    375  f1ac							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
    376  f1ac							; Always re-samples StepsLeft (title-owned on intro/title frames;
    377  f1ac							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    378  f1ac							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    379  f1ac							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
    380  f1ac							; Clobbers A/X/Temp. Ends at TitleTailAudio (silence + overscan wait).
    381  f1ac							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
