   1685  facc							; PairGone — leaf in the pre-BMW free zone ($FACC..$FB0F). Called ONLY for
   1686  facc							;   rect idx4 (the sole maskless slot), so rect4.x is deref'd here directly
   1687  facc							;   (RcW1+16 = rect4.x — EQU-derived, not a magic number). Returns Z=1 iff
   1688  facc							;   cols (rect4.x, rect4.x+1) are BOTH clear in row LineCount (pair present
   1689  facc							;   anywhere in the span ⇒ Z=0). Rect idx4 has no WallMask bit (BombMaskBit
   1690  facc							;   is 4-wide, b3-6), so this single-row buffer read replaces the mask
   1691  facc							;   double-score guard for that slot only — first blast sees the pair
   1692  facc							;   solid, any re-blast sees it clear and skips (parity: idx0-3 keep the
   1693  facc							;   mask path untouched). Pair x is even (cell-aligned) and ≠0 (caller
   1694  facc							;   gates), so x and x+1 always share one PF buffer. Clobbers A,X,Y,Temp.
   1695  facc							;   Same-bank jsr legal (no pad nesting).
   1696  facc				   PairGone
